        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0865a13b-d7a0-5da0-8252-afbd6ec4b736",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Evan Almighty, Bruce Almighty, The Office\n- People: Tom Shadyac, Steve Oedekerk, Steve Koren, Mark O'Keefe, Steve Carell, Morgan Freeman, Lauren Graham, John Goodman\n- Concepts: sequel, spin-off, character creation\n\nFacts:\n- Bruce Almighty is a 2003 film that originated the characters later used for Evan Almighty.\n- The Office is an American television series that ran from 2005 to 2011.\n- Steve Carell is best known for playing Michael Scott on the American version of The Office from 2005 to 2011.\n- Steve Carell also worked on The Office as an occasional writer, producer, and director.\n- Evan Almighty is a 2007 American fantasy comedy film.\n- Evan Almighty is a stand-alone sequel and spin-off to Bruce Almighty.\n- Tom Shadyac directed Evan Almighty.\n- Steve Oedekerk wrote Evan Almighty.\n- Steve Koren and Mark O'Keefe created the original film characters on which Evan Almighty is based.\n- Evan Almighty stars Steve Carell, Morgan Freeman, Lauren Graham, and John Goodman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
