        "text": "Page: Evan Almighty. Sentence: Evan Almighty is a 2007 American fantasy comedy film and the stand-alone sequel/spin-off to \"Bruce Almighty\" (2003).\nPage: Evan Almighty. Sentence: The film was directed by Tom Shadyac, written by Steve Oedekerk, based on the characters created by Steve Koren and Mark O'Keefe from the original film, and starring Steve Carell, Morgan Freeman, Lauren Graham and John Goodman.\nPage: Steve Carell. Sentence: Carell is best known for playing Michael Scott on the American version of \"The Office\" (2005–2011), on which he also worked as an occasional writer, producer, and director.",
